      "content": "That's an interesting pivot. So, if we go with your new suggestion of \"encouraging\" these discussions, how should the policy handle employees who see these \"vital discussions\" as purely political or even offensive to their own religious or personal values? If someone feels that the workplace is being dominated by a specific ideological framework under the guise of \"progressive culture,\" wouldn't that actually destroy the \"cohesion\" we're trying to save?",
